				<wikidot:authorName>faminepulse</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4275444</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This is a companion to #Xiupania and the other Oneiroi format tales.</p> <p>It's also a formatting and multimedia &quot;practice&quot; article for the new Holy Science format I'm working on.</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Sources</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Formatted&nbsp;by&nbsp;ElogeeFishTruck</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Sunny Clockwork did the Xiupania logo on the bottom, and I animated it.<br /> <strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Music:</span></strong></p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Source:</strong> <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wfPKs88XaoM">YouTube</a><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>Title:</strong> Tom Spander - Oceania [Tropical House]<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> Tom Spander<br /> <strong>Release year:</strong> 2018</p> </blockquote> <p><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Video:</span></strong></p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Source:</strong> <a href="https://pixabay.com/cs/videos/mo%C5%99e-pl%C3%A1%C5%BE-vlna-surfovat-voda-7117/">Pixabay</a><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC0<br /> <strong>Title:</strong> Moře Pláž Vlna<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> Thoma_Ritter<br /> <strong>Release year:</strong> 2017<br /> <strong>Note:</strong> Pixabay moved to its own Pixabay License in January 2019, but CC0 is still applied to images uploaded before January 2019. See <a href="https://pixabay.com/ja/forum/official-pixabay-news-2/the-pixabay-license-7823/">here</a> for details.</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Source:</strong> <a href="https://dramafast.com/videos/?vid=100">DramaFast</a><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC0<br /> <strong>Title:</strong> Dog At The Beach<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> N/A<br /> <strong>Release year:</strong> N/A</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Source:</strong> <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:2019-12-27-beach-worming.webm">Wikimedia Commons</a><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY-SA 4.0<br /> <strong>Title:</strong> 2019-12-27-beach-worming.webm<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> Cabrils<br /> <strong>Release year:</strong> 2019</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Source:</strong> <a href="https://pixabay.com/cs/videos/dragonfly-hmyz-k%C5%99%C3%ADdlo-letu-hmyzu-3650/">Pixabay</a><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC0<br /> <strong>Title:</strong> Dragonfly Hmyz Křídlo Letu<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> annca<br /> <strong>Release year:</strong> 2016<br /> <strong>Note:</strong> Pixabay moved to its own Pixabay License in January 2019, but CC0 is still applied to images uploaded before January 2019. See <a href="https://pixabay.com/ja/forum/official-pixabay-news-2/the-pixabay-license-7823/">here</a> for details.</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Source:</strong> <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:De_lange_hete_zomer-515924.ogv">Wikimedia Commons</a><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY-SA 3.0 NL<br /> <strong>Title:</strong> De lange hete zomer-515924.ogv<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> Polygoon-Profilti<br /> <strong>Release year:</strong> 1975</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Source:</strong> <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3Wq8dvwIUNk">YouTube</a><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY 3.0<br /> <strong>Title:</strong> Sea lamprey being removed from live trout<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> LampreyControl<br /> <strong>Release year:</strong> 2011</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Source:</strong> <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dragonfly_(Sympetrum_infuscatum).webm">Wikimedia Commons</a><br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY-SA 4.0<br /> <strong>Title:</strong> Dragonfly (Sympetrum infuscatum).webm<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> The Nature Box<br /> <strong>Release